<section class="faq section-shell" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p>
    <h2 id="faq-title">Common questions</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq__list">
    <details>
      <summary>Can white noise keep playing when my phone is locked?</summary>
      <p>
        Usually, yes. This page uses normal media playback so supported browsers
        can keep it playing with the screen locked. Your device settings may
        still affect playback.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Will it work without an internet connection?</summary>
      <p>
        Yes, after one successful online visit. Keep this page bookmarked, and
        the player and sound will be available from your browser's offline
        storage.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How loud should it be?</summary>
      <p>
        Use the lowest effective volume and keep the device well away from the
        cot. Sound levels vary between phones and speakers, so check the volume
        from where your baby sleeps.
      </p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Do I need to install an app?</summary>
      <p>
        No. It works in your browser. On supported devices, you can add it to
        your home screen for quicker access.
      </p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

